= A Phone Call

A whistleblower alleges that the president pressed a foreign leader to investigate a political rival while withholding military aid. Pressure builds on the House to act. The Senate will not convict.

- @impeach: Impeach.
- @censure: Pursue censure and investigation.
- @avoid: Avoid impeachment. Focus on the election.

@impeach
subtitle: Principle over strategy.
on-arrival: stability += 4; enthusiasm += 4; maga += 3; mod_dissent += 3; unity += 2

The House impeaches. The Senate acquits. The record is made.

@censure
subtitle: Lower-risk.
on-arrival: stability += 1; media_trust += 1; enthusiasm -= 2; prog_dissent += 4

The pressure on the leadership is intense. They resist.

@avoid
subtitle: Political caution.
on-arrival: stability -= 3; enthusiasm -= 4; prog_dissent += 5; mod_dissent -= 3

We decide that the voters will decide. Many wonder what norms are left.
